# SleepKnight8 Themes

A simple reusable theme library for SleepKnight8 projects.

Currently includes:

* 🟡 Yellow Theme
* 🟣 Purple Theme
* Automatic theme saving with `localStorage`
* Buttons, inputs, links, surfaces, sliders, and other common elements

## Usage

### 1. Add the CSS

```html
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/SleepKnight8/SleepKnight8_Themes/themes.css">
```

### 2. Add the JavaScript

Place this before your own JavaScript:

```html
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/SleepKnight8/SleepKnight8_Themes/themes.js"></script>
<script src="index.js"></script>
```

### 3. Add theme buttons

```html
<button onclick="setTheme('yellow')">🟡</button>
<button onclick="setTheme('purple')">🟣</button>
```

### 4. Keep your own layout

Create your own `style.css` for:

* Layout
* Sizes
* Spacing
* Project-specific colors
* Project-specific components

The theme library handles the **overall appearance**, so you can freely create different layouts.

## Example

```text
MyProject/
├── index.html
├── style.css
└── index.js
```

You **do not need to copy `themes.css` or `themes.js`** into your project.

Just load them from the library online.
